WEBVTT

00:00:03.151 --> 00:00:06.324
POPPY:
This is Branch's bunker.

00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:10.629
He built this for you guys.

00:00:11.628 --> 00:00:13.500
I didn't know.

00:00:14.829 --> 00:00:17.130
I guess you never asked.

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:20.270
Wait.

00:00:20.405 --> 00:00:22.139
Grandma got eaten?

00:00:22.274 --> 00:00:24.644
♪ ♪

00:00:25.313 --> 00:00:26.978
POPPY:
Branch, wait!

00:00:27.114 --> 00:00:28.179
Branch!

00:00:28.315 --> 00:00:29.445
Where are you going?

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.346
To save Floyd-- alone.

00:00:31.482 --> 00:00:34.218
I didn't need them growing up,
and I don't need them now.

00:00:34.354 --> 00:00:35.983
What-what are you doing?

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:38.552
What do you mean?
I'm coming with you.

00:00:38.688 --> 00:00:40.120
(scoffs) Why bother?

00:00:40.256 --> 00:00:43.029
Aren't you gonna leave me
eventually anyway?

00:00:43.165 --> 00:00:45.125
Everyone else does.

00:00:48.671 --> 00:00:51.731
I have been by your side
from the moment we met.

00:00:51.867 --> 00:00:53.804
And you've been by mine.

00:00:53.939 --> 00:00:56.540
Let's give each other
some credit here.

00:00:56.675 --> 00:00:58.505
(sighs) Right. Uh, I'm sorry.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:00:59.540
Thank you.

00:00:59.676 --> 00:01:01.479
You're welcome.

00:01:01.614 --> 00:01:03.682
And I'm not going anywhere.

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:06.513
Unless it's with you...

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:08.383
to save Floyd.

00:01:08.518 --> 00:01:10.991
♪ ♪

00:01:11.126 --> 00:01:13.154
(bell jingling)

00:01:13.757 --> 00:01:15.589
Tiny! You're coming, too?

00:01:15.725 --> 00:01:17.258
Hey, what can I say?

00:01:17.394 --> 00:01:21.232
I was moved by Branch's speech
and his sad, sad drawing.

00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:22.595
Now, let's roll!

00:01:22.731 --> 00:01:24.300
(tires squeal)

00:01:24.436 --> 00:01:26.199
(bell jingles)

00:01:27.141 --> 00:01:29.675
♪ ♪

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:32.579
Wow, Grissy.

00:01:32.714 --> 00:01:33.905
I've never seen anyone
get kicked out

00:01:34.041 --> 00:01:35.649
of a water park like that.

00:01:35.784 --> 00:01:37.645
All right, for the record,
it was the waterslide

00:01:37.781 --> 00:01:39.084
that ripped off my trunks.

00:01:39.219 --> 00:01:40.921
Ooh, so hot.

00:01:41.056 --> 00:01:42.120
(sniffing)

00:01:42.256 --> 00:01:43.524
Wait. (sniffs)

00:01:43.659 --> 00:01:45.888
- Do you smell...
- (tires squeal, engine revs)

00:01:46.023 --> 00:01:49.695
- French fries!
- (gasps) French fries.

00:01:50.791 --> 00:01:53.160
♪ ♪

00:01:53.996 --> 00:01:56.196
(Putt Putt trolls whispering)

00:01:58.539 --> 00:02:00.132
- (Gristle gasps)
- BRIDGET: Ew.

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:02.140
BOOMING VOICE:
Who goes there?

00:02:02.276 --> 00:02:03.610
(both scream)

00:02:03.745 --> 00:02:05.775
PUTT PUTT TROLLS:
Putt-putt. Putt-putt. Putt-putt.

00:02:05.911 --> 00:02:07.873
Putt-putt.
Putt-putt. Putt-putt.

00:02:08.008 --> 00:02:09.609
Are those golf balls?

00:02:09.744 --> 00:02:11.109
Putt-putt!

00:02:11.245 --> 00:02:13.118
Oh, good. They're just trolls.

00:02:13.254 --> 00:02:14.288
Look how cute.

00:02:14.423 --> 00:02:16.656
- (grunting)
- (screaming)

00:02:18.325 --> 00:02:19.520
What's happening?

00:02:19.655 --> 00:02:21.489
(both screaming)

00:02:21.624 --> 00:02:22.592
(both grunt)

00:02:22.727 --> 00:02:24.193
Grissy, I didn't think

00:02:24.328 --> 00:02:27.161
we'd both find ourselves
tied up on this honeymoon.

00:02:29.437 --> 00:02:32.166
(whooping, playful yelling)

00:02:33.771 --> 00:02:35.307
BRANCH:
All right, look.

00:02:35.442 --> 00:02:36.909
Security is really tight,

00:02:37.044 --> 00:02:38.708
so we're not gonna be able
to just walk right in.

00:02:38.844 --> 00:02:39.905
POPPY:
You know what that means.

00:02:40.041 --> 00:02:41.106
We're scaling the walls.

00:02:41.241 --> 00:02:43.211
We're, huh? Doing what? When?

00:02:43.346 --> 00:02:44.948
BRANCH: <i>We should plan
to make our ascent</i>

00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:47.852
<i>about 200 meters east
of the entrance.</i>

00:02:47.987 --> 00:02:49.948
Good thing I brought
extra gummy gloves.

00:02:50.084 --> 00:02:52.459
I'm tired. Carry me.

00:02:52.594 --> 00:02:53.924
You have to walk
on your own, Tiny.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:56.195
- You have to be a big boy.
- But my feet hurt.

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:57.864
I don't wanna!

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.428
BRANCH: <i>The quickest way in
will be at the roof.</i>

00:02:59.563 --> 00:03:00.763
The HVAC system.

00:03:00.898 --> 00:03:03.069
Ooh. I love how you say "HVAC."

00:03:03.204 --> 00:03:04.364
Thank you.

00:03:04.499 --> 00:03:06.069
BRANCH: But we'll have to
bypass the fan blade

00:03:06.204 --> 00:03:09.440
so that our "cupcakes"
don't get sliced in two.

00:03:09.575 --> 00:03:10.740
Ooh! We brought cupcakes?

00:03:10.875 --> 00:03:12.410
- Um, no.
- No. Not what I meant.

00:03:12.546 --> 00:03:14.179
It-it doesn't matter.

00:03:14.314 --> 00:03:16.617
♪ ♪

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:22.986
(whirring, rumbling)

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:26.154
- (Poppy whooping)
- BRANCH: <i>After that, we need</i>

00:03:26.289 --> 00:03:28.394
<i>to cut the power
so we can move freely</i>

00:03:28.529 --> 00:03:29.827
<i>through the interior air ducts.</i>

00:03:29.962 --> 00:03:31.357
How do you know
which wires to cut?

00:03:31.492 --> 00:03:33.228
I don't.
I'm just blasting everything

00:03:33.364 --> 00:03:36.296
- until something turns off.
- (power whirring down)

00:03:37.204 --> 00:03:37.998
Hello?

00:03:38.133 --> 00:03:39.364
BRANCH:
<i>From there,</i>

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.237
<i>we'll have
to do some exploring,</i>

00:03:41.373 --> 00:03:42.769
<i>but we'll find Floyd
in one of those rooms.</i>

00:03:42.904 --> 00:03:45.173
Look. There he is.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.014
Come on.

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.450
Floyd.

00:03:55.586 --> 00:03:57.090
Branch?

00:03:57.226 --> 00:03:58.321
Is it really you?

00:03:58.456 --> 00:03:59.489
Yeah.

00:03:59.625 --> 00:04:00.993
It's really me.

00:04:01.129 --> 00:04:02.190
Wow.

00:04:02.325 --> 00:04:03.922
You've really grown
into that vest.

00:04:04.057 --> 00:04:05.525
You're a man now.

00:04:05.661 --> 00:04:06.728
Oh!

00:04:06.864 --> 00:04:09.395
Finally, somebody gets me.

00:04:12.474 --> 00:04:14.171
But you need to leave right now.

00:04:14.306 --> 00:04:16.205
No, Floyd, it's okay.
We're here to rescue you.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.376
No, th-this is a trap.
Velvet and Veneer, they...

00:04:18.512 --> 00:04:19.812
they lured you here.

00:04:19.947 --> 00:04:21.208
You got to leave
before they come back. Hurry!

00:04:21.343 --> 00:04:23.777
No, I'm not leaving here
without you.

00:04:23.912 --> 00:04:25.179
Branch, please.

00:04:25.315 --> 00:04:26.652
- Do it for me.
- VELVET: We're so close.

00:04:26.788 --> 00:04:28.554
I told you BroZone
would show up.

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:30.384
My letter worked. I'm a genius.

00:04:30.519 --> 00:04:32.924
VENEER: Are you sure
you're sure about this?

00:04:36.562 --> 00:04:38.127
(Rhonda grunts)

00:04:42.303 --> 00:04:43.801
Oh, no.

00:04:43.937 --> 00:04:45.365
- (Rhonda grunting, growling)
- Ow! Ow!

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.439
It's biting me.
Put it in the closet!

00:04:47.574 --> 00:04:48.901
Put it in the closet!

00:04:49.037 --> 00:04:50.777
CRIMP:
Hello.

00:04:51.711 --> 00:04:52.643
- Floyd!
- Floyd!

00:04:52.778 --> 00:04:53.709
- Hey, bro.
- Brothers.

00:04:53.845 --> 00:04:54.844
It's so good to see you.

00:04:54.979 --> 00:04:56.477
We would have been here sooner,

00:04:56.613 --> 00:04:58.184
but these guys wouldn't stop
yelling at each other.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:04:59.312
Guys, please.

00:04:59.447 --> 00:05:00.952
John Dory,
you're the one who parked

00:05:01.087 --> 00:05:02.315
in the spot marked
"reserved for BroZone."

00:05:02.451 --> 00:05:04.122
Didn't that seem
a little sus to you?

00:05:04.257 --> 00:05:05.955
- Oh, so it's my fault?
- (chuckling): Oh, look.

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:07.989
They're even cute
when they fight.

00:05:08.125 --> 00:05:09.455
- Boop, boop, boop.
- Ow! Stop!

00:05:09.591 --> 00:05:11.027
- Boop, boop, boop, boop.
- What are you doing?

00:05:11.163 --> 00:05:12.525
Come on, man.
You're better than this.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:13.960
- Well, thank you.
- VELVET: I really don't see

00:05:14.096 --> 00:05:15.462
why you're so upset.

00:05:15.597 --> 00:05:17.129
At least we're putting
your talent to good use.

00:05:17.264 --> 00:05:18.866
I mean, you're welcome.

00:05:19.001 --> 00:05:20.501
What? You're sick.

00:05:20.637 --> 00:05:23.172
You mispronounced "Thanks for
not letting our talents

00:05:23.307 --> 00:05:25.341
go to waste anymore,
Velvet and Veneer."

00:05:25.477 --> 00:05:28.342
Come on. They're waiting for us
on the red carpet.

00:05:28.477 --> 00:05:30.884
- Ooh!
- Let's go autograph some butts.

00:05:31.019 --> 00:05:34.282
Oh, that's fun.
I'll grab my butt marker.

